ns.\n\nP2: label body.branch as advisory wherever it is rendered and keep authority on immutable artifact commits. Add a runnable multi-artifact merge example showing a candidate artifact at the approved head bounding same-path retirement of another actor's in-main predecessor; attempting to cite that predecessor in review should fail because it is not at the reviewed head.\n\nP2 repository safety: put the user's prohibited deletion-command rule in the actual AGENTS.md and add a docset check for prohibited invocations inside executable shell blocks, while allowing prose that discusses them.\n\nMachine-generated facts should cover clean/pushed equality, merge base, changed paths, reviewed scope, and succession topology. Human prose should record judgment: architecture, security, simplification, and tradeoffs. This assertion assigns no implementation; selected items need separate durable requests."}